                                                "sense_id": "2e617c5f-0518-3850-a575-20179ffff50e",
                                                "text": "When Dalim became reanimated at night he ate whatever food he liked, for of such there was a plentiful stock in the garden-house, walked about on the premises, and meditated on the singularity of his lot."
